          <a class="stat stat-link stat-low-priority" href="?priority=Low" target="_blank" rel="opener" aria-label="Open low-priority tickets in a new tab"><div class="stat-label">Low priority tickets</div><div class="stat-value" id="stat-low-priority">0</div><div class="stat-note">Tickets that can be handled as time allows</div></a>
